 "remarks": "Luxury & convenience at Park Tower, stunning concierge building, in the heart of downtown Stamford & all it has to offer. This corner unit is spacious offering 2BRS, 2.5BTHS, 1684 SF living space. Move in ready, & freshly painted, it offers an open concept living, floor to ceiling windows, separate space for office surrounded by glass, & patio for relaxing. The EIK offers newer GE & Bosch appliances (2021), & a wine chiller. There is a large center island. The primary BR, w/walk in closet has a private bath, a whirlpool tub & separate shower, double sink vanity, marble & updated. The 2nd BR is ensuite; tub/shower, & walk in closet. The 1/2 BTH is easy access. Enjoy all the amenities included in the rent, 24 concierge,fitness center,& all season pool. Parking is extra, & privately owned & operated. Single is $230/255, tandem $322 monthly. Strong credit a must, along with references. No Pets. Minutes to highway, train, shopping & theater.",
